### Get fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields

### Get rounds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rounds

### Get questions by field and round
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questions?fieldId=1&roundId=5
### Get interview questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/interview/questions?roleName=Frontend%20Developer&skill=React&difficulty=Easy

### Save interview session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interview/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 14,
  "roleName": "Frontend Developer",
  "skill": "React",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "results": [
    {
      "roundId": "aptitude",
      "score": 1,
      "total": 1,
      "answers": {
        "0": "12"
      },
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Get dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/14/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get session history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/14/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one session analysis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/14/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/14/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/14/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "siva",
  "email": "siva@gmail.com",
  "careerGoal": "Frontend Developer",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "weeklyTarget": 5,
  "profilePicture": ""
}
